    "text": "My name is Anna. This is my brother. His name is Tom. This is my mother. Her name is Sue. Tom and I are students. Our mother is a nurse. Our father is a driver. Their names are Sue and Paul.",
    "es": "Me llamo Anna. Este es mi hermano. Su nombre es Tom. Esta es mi madre. Su nombre es Sue. Tom y yo somos estudiantes. Nuestra madre es enfermera. Nuestro padre es conductor. Sus nombres son Sue y Paul.",
    "glossary": [
      {
        "id": "en-my",
        "lemma": "my",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/maɪ/",
        "es": "mi",
        "example": "This is my brother."
      },
      {
        "id": "en-your",
        "lemma": "your",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/jɔː/",
        "es": "tu",
        "example": "What's your name?"
      },
      {
        "id": "en-his",
        "lemma": "his",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/hɪz/",
        "es": "su (de él)",
        "example": "His name is Tom."
      },
      {
        "id": "en-her",
        "lemma": "her",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/hɜː/",
        "es": "su (de ella)",
        "example": "Her name is Sue."
      },
      {
        "id": "en-our",
        "lemma": "our",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/ˈaʊə/",
        "es": "nuestro/a",
        "example": "Our mother is a nurse."
      },
      {
        "id": "en-their",
        "lemma": "their",
        "pos": "det",
        "ipa": "/ðeə/",
        "es": "su (de ellos/as)",
        "example": "Their names are Sue and Paul."
      }
    ]
  },
  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "| Sujeto | Posesivo |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| I | my |",
      "| you | your |",
      "| he | his |",
      "| she | her |",
      "| it | its |",
      "| we | our |",
      "| they | their |",
      "",
      "**Regla clave:** el posesivo depende de **quién es el dueño**, no de la cosa: *Tom's sister* → *his sister*; *Anna's brother* → *her brother*.",
      "",
      "Los posesivos **no cambian** con el plural: *my brothers*."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "Anna is my sister. She name is Anna.",
        "right": "Her name is Anna.",
        "note": "Se usa el posesivo (her), no el pronombre (she)."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "mys brothers",
        "right": "my brothers",
        "note": "Los posesivos no cambian en plural."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
